  "paper_id": "ccs-2025-h-eracles-chosen-plaintext-attack-on-amd-sev-snp-648c62cf",
  "title": "H eracles : Chosen Plaintext Attack on AMD SEV-SNP",
  "abstract": "Confidential computing needs hardware support that stops privileged software from learning secrets of a guest virtual machine. AMD offers such hardware support in the form of SEV-SNP to create confidential virtual machines, such that hardware encrypts all the VM memory. Specifically, SEV-SNP uses the XEX encryption mode with address-dependent tweak values such that the same plaintext at different memory addresses yields different ciphertexts.",
